      "transcript_text": "Alright, I've got it. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with an anxiety disorder at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling anxious most of the day for about a month, and no alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself.",
