      "transcript_text": "Regular exercise and less caffeine make a real difference. Slow breathing, in for four and out for six, for a few minutes whenever it builds up. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. We'll refer you to a counsellor. Keep an eye out, and if you have thoughts of harming yourself, call us the same day or go to emergency.",
